WEBVTT

00:03.160 --> 00:06.770
Fight for your justice,
show your courage.

00:06.770 --> 00:10.370
Right! Grasp truth in these hands.

00:10.370 --> 00:13.780
Fight for your justice, I want you

00:13.780 --> 00:21.200
as you fight through
with your head held up high.

00:35.860 --> 00:39.930
Rather than polishing diamonds

00:43.040 --> 00:46.970
give me a glistening future.

00:50.250 --> 00:52.480
Even if nothing's there, get up.

00:52.480 --> 00:56.350
It's important to turn on the switch.

00:57.450 --> 01:00.220
Something new that I don't want to yield.

01:00.220 --> 01:04.750
Seeking it is justice!

01:06.360 --> 01:09.930
Fight for your justice,
be serious about it.

01:09.930 --> 01:13.540
Right! Face reality head on.

01:13.540 --> 01:16.940
Fight for your justice,
I love how you

01:16.940 --> 01:27.340
never give up even if
the current is against you.

01:38.190 --> 01:40.350
Hurry, hurry, hurry...

01:47.200 --> 01:49.900
Sorry to make you wait, Mr. Alien!

01:53.680 --> 01:55.840
Hey, Hibiki, is it yummy?

01:55.840 --> 01:57.240
Yeah, it's great.

02:04.520 --> 02:05.720
What are you doing?

02:05.720 --> 02:07.060
So cruel!

02:07.060 --> 02:11.490
Mr. Alien likes rice
more than bread like this!

02:17.270 --> 02:18.330
Great!

02:18.330 --> 02:20.370
You haven't even kissed him yet.

02:20.370 --> 02:22.030
What?

02:26.440 --> 02:29.440
Hey, it's your turn.

02:29.440 --> 02:31.280
Whoa, that's right.

02:31.280 --> 02:32.940
The match...

02:38.820 --> 02:40.720
Ms. Gasco, what is this?

02:40.720 --> 02:43.990
Hibiki debates everything,
and it took too long.

02:43.990 --> 02:47.560
So I decided each turn is 3 minutes.

02:47.560 --> 02:50.000
And it's not "Gasco"...

02:50.000 --> 02:51.930
...it's "Gascogne."

02:51.930 --> 02:54.040
So picky about everything...

02:54.040 --> 02:56.940
Not much time left.

02:56.940 --> 03:01.240
I know!

03:01.240 --> 03:04.310
I'll take my chances with this!

03:04.310 --> 03:05.970
2 face cards!

03:09.250 --> 03:10.910
Full house.

03:14.360 --> 03:15.620
I lost again.

03:15.620 --> 03:17.890
It's your fault Hibiki lost!

03:17.890 --> 03:20.930
What? It's your fault!

03:20.930 --> 03:23.030
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

03:23.030 --> 03:26.100
This calls for one more hand!

03:26.100 --> 03:28.500
You never get enough, do you?

03:32.370 --> 03:34.580
How do I look? Stunning?

03:34.580 --> 03:37.010
Totally great! No room for complaints!

03:37.010 --> 03:39.080
The holy mother from any angle!

03:39.080 --> 03:40.520
Don't I? Don't I? Don't I?

03:40.520 --> 03:42.820
I look good no matter what I do!

03:42.820 --> 03:44.990
What should I do? So bothersome...

03:44.990 --> 03:46.550
This is no time to laugh!

03:46.550 --> 03:49.020
You have to be more
gentle when handling her!

03:49.020 --> 03:50.630
You're so annoying every time!

03:50.630 --> 03:53.660
At least stay out of things
while I'm taking pictures!

03:53.660 --> 03:56.730
Here, you'll be happy
if I return her, right?

03:56.730 --> 03:59.890
Have a more caring heart!

04:01.900 --> 04:03.440
There, there.

04:03.440 --> 04:06.870
Let's take a nap!

04:06.870 --> 04:08.280
So cute!

04:08.280 --> 04:10.770
I want a baby soon, too!

04:14.420 --> 04:16.120
She looks so fragile.

04:16.120 --> 04:17.880
Ribbit, ribbit, boo!

04:20.920 --> 04:22.790
She doesn't laugh at all.

04:22.790 --> 04:25.130
It hasn't been long since she was born.

04:25.130 --> 04:28.200
She can't clearly recognize things.

04:28.200 --> 04:30.970
It'll be a while before
she shows expressions.

04:30.970 --> 04:33.470
Well, anyway, the baby is amusing.

04:33.470 --> 04:34.770
She's not "the baby"!

04:34.770 --> 04:36.470
She's Pyoro-2!

04:36.470 --> 04:37.910
No, Pyoro.

04:37.910 --> 04:40.380
It's Kahlua!

04:40.380 --> 04:42.840
Kahlua, huh?

04:42.840 --> 04:44.680
The captain named her.

04:44.680 --> 04:49.280
I want to call her Pyoro-2,
so it's okay to call her Pyoro-2!

04:49.280 --> 04:52.550
Long-range radar is
picking up an enemy fleet!

04:54.890 --> 04:57.060
A mothership for the harvest?

04:57.060 --> 04:59.860
Yes, it's set on a course for Mejale.

04:59.860 --> 05:02.100
It must be one of the squads

05:02.100 --> 05:04.800
that changed course as a
result of our recent battle.

05:04.800 --> 05:06.130
It's changed course!

05:06.130 --> 05:08.240
It's headed straight for us!

05:08.240 --> 05:09.700
I guess we have no choice.

05:09.700 --> 05:11.800
We have to get them.

05:16.310 --> 05:18.710
So they're here.

05:18.710 --> 05:22.210
And it was just getting good, too!

05:23.650 --> 05:24.450
What's wrong?

05:24.450 --> 05:27.560
When we defeat the enemy,
we'll resume this match.

05:27.560 --> 05:30.360
Until then, I'm keeping
this score unsettled!

05:30.360 --> 05:32.880
Your hand must be some sight.

05:48.280 --> 05:50.510
Jura, you know the plan, right?

05:50.510 --> 05:51.510
Leave it to me.

05:51.510 --> 05:53.010
I'm the main character today!

05:53.010 --> 05:55.140
Who is it? Who?

06:00.220 --> 06:03.520
I'll get rid of them all this time!

06:04.560 --> 06:06.160
What's with you, Mr. Alien?

06:06.160 --> 06:08.430
You're going for all the others today.

06:08.430 --> 06:10.470
Dita, Formation Delta Four!

06:10.470 --> 06:11.500
Follow me!

06:11.500 --> 06:13.160
R-Roger!

06:16.670 --> 06:18.570
Bart, full speed ahead!

06:18.570 --> 06:21.340
Roger that! I'm a main character, too!

06:26.580 --> 06:30.350
Are we really taking on that
huge fleet by ourselves?

06:30.350 --> 06:32.990
We've already won against them before.

06:32.990 --> 06:35.560
Experience turns itself into confidence.

06:35.560 --> 06:37.860
We'll surround them with Vandread Jura

06:37.860 --> 06:40.830
and get them with one blast
from the main cannon! It's easy!

06:42.060 --> 06:43.500
That's really reckless

06:43.500 --> 06:47.400
but I think I like
how confident the crew is.

06:50.670 --> 06:52.370
Here they come! Commence fire!

06:52.370 --> 06:54.200
Leader, look at that!

07:03.180 --> 07:05.240
- Wha...
- Y-You're kidding!

07:09.560 --> 07:10.530
The Nirvana?

07:10.530 --> 07:12.760
Pyoro-2 shouldn't see things like that.

07:12.760 --> 07:14.130
It's always been fact

07:14.130 --> 07:17.400
that fakes are weaker
than the real thing!

07:17.400 --> 07:19.060
Calm down, Bart.

07:20.470 --> 07:21.870
Damn them!

07:21.870 --> 07:23.640
They're just putting up a front!

07:23.640 --> 07:24.670
Just watch.

07:24.670 --> 07:26.470
I'll get them all!

07:36.780 --> 07:39.190
Meia! Dita!

07:39.190 --> 07:41.590
- This pain...
- Just like before!

07:48.360 --> 07:50.660
Come on, outta my way!

07:55.340 --> 07:57.070
You're in my way!

08:00.140 --> 08:02.040
Bart, follow their lead!

08:02.040 --> 08:03.640
Roger that!

08:03.640 --> 08:06.200
Hibiki, hurry up and surround them!

08:11.790 --> 08:13.980
Damn it, I know!

08:16.520 --> 08:18.190
Commence holding!

08:24.930 --> 08:26.900
Vandread Jura's creating the shield!

08:26.900 --> 08:28.870
Enemy fleet held back!

08:32.470 --> 08:33.570
How's that?

08:33.570 --> 08:35.570
You can't move, can you?

08:42.120 --> 08:43.780
What?

08:50.320 --> 08:52.290
Hey, we're toast if we don't split.

08:52.290 --> 08:54.260
What are you doing? Hey!

09:01.370 --> 09:02.670
Jura!

09:02.670 --> 09:04.800
How dare you do that to Jura!

09:08.710 --> 09:10.510
Pull back, Barnette.

09:10.510 --> 09:13.780
What they're doing is
way beyond our expectations.

09:13.780 --> 09:15.420
We need to regroup first.

09:15.420 --> 09:17.050
But Jura...

09:17.050 --> 09:19.950
No way you can win
when you're so hotheaded.

09:19.950 --> 09:21.750
This is an order.

09:26.430 --> 09:28.090
Don't get in my way!

09:33.300 --> 09:34.960
Jura...

09:36.740 --> 09:38.500
She's bleeding heavily.

09:39.910 --> 09:43.540
Her life's spared,
but the wound on her abdomen...

09:43.540 --> 09:44.980
Jura...

09:44.980 --> 09:48.280
Treat her so she won't have
any scars left, will ya?

09:48.280 --> 09:51.750
You can trust Mejale's
technology in that aspect.

09:51.750 --> 09:53.920
You're up next.

09:53.920 --> 09:56.020
There's nothing to these.

09:56.020 --> 09:57.460
They're just scratches.

09:57.460 --> 09:58.890
Mr. Alien...

09:58.890 --> 10:00.190
I can't allow that.

10:00.190 --> 10:02.630
Let me look at your personal data.

10:02.630 --> 10:05.060
I need information so I can treat you.

10:06.070 --> 10:07.730
Do what you like!

10:09.800 --> 10:11.470
Damn it!

10:11.470 --> 10:13.130
Mr. Alien!

10:17.650 --> 10:19.510
Damn it...

10:19.510 --> 10:22.480
It's all because I underestimated them!

10:22.480 --> 10:24.050
That's not true.

10:24.050 --> 10:25.150
Mr. Alien...

10:25.150 --> 10:26.290
Shut up!

10:26.290 --> 10:28.560
You keep quiet!

10:28.560 --> 10:32.160
You don't have to take
it out on Dita, right?

10:32.160 --> 10:35.130
Where did your usual high spirits go?

10:45.310 --> 10:48.780
Everyone's got such
dreary looks on their faces.

10:48.780 --> 10:51.610
There's no point to staying here.

10:51.610 --> 10:53.880
How about getting back to your posts?

10:53.880 --> 10:55.380
Why?

10:55.380 --> 10:57.320
Why'd you refuse the delivery?

10:57.320 --> 11:00.010
I wanted to keep fighting for Jura!

11:09.800 --> 11:12.430
How far are we going to run?

11:12.430 --> 11:14.700
Until we have a chance to fight back.

11:14.700 --> 11:17.970
That's not it!
I was asking about a destination!

11:17.970 --> 11:19.770
I'm thinking about that now!

11:19.770 --> 11:23.240
Shut up and go! You're good
at running away, aren't you?

11:23.240 --> 11:24.580
Understood.

11:26.010 --> 11:28.350
Answer me, Ms. Gasco!

11:28.350 --> 11:30.890
I knew your death would've been a waste.

11:30.890 --> 11:32.990
But we can't win without fighting!

11:32.990 --> 11:35.790
If we can't win,
we'll die in the end anyway!

11:35.790 --> 11:39.060
At that point, we failed our mission.

11:39.060 --> 11:40.830
It's a stagehand's job

11:40.830 --> 11:44.600
to pull down actors who
forget how the scene goes.

11:44.600 --> 11:47.730
How can you be so cold like that?

11:48.870 --> 11:52.830
You tend to make wrong decisions
if you let your feelings rule you.

11:54.280 --> 11:58.450
Of course you can stay calm
if you watch from the back.

11:58.450 --> 11:59.780
Mr. Alien...

11:59.780 --> 12:02.780
Someone who casually
watches from the back

12:02.780 --> 12:05.720
can never understand
the feelings of those

12:05.720 --> 12:09.160
desperately fighting
on the front lines!

12:09.160 --> 12:12.090
You always smirk like that.

12:12.090 --> 12:15.960
Someone sarcastically telling us
our mistakes were to be expected.

12:15.960 --> 12:20.100
Someone who can't understand
those desperate to stay alive!

12:20.100 --> 12:22.470
Someone who can't
understand others' pain!

12:29.240 --> 12:31.230
This is so pitiful.

12:32.580 --> 12:34.950
What comes out of making excuses?

12:34.950 --> 12:38.350
I'll make as many as you want
if it means we can stay alive.

12:38.350 --> 12:40.290
If you still wanna make 'em

12:40.290 --> 12:45.130
you can make as many as
you want in the afterlife!

12:45.130 --> 12:47.460
But I'll have no part of it!

12:47.460 --> 12:51.120
I'll clench my teeth and
make sure I survive it all!

13:07.250 --> 13:08.720
Hibiki.

13:08.720 --> 13:12.420
- Let me tend to your wounds.
- Sure...

13:12.420 --> 13:14.790
Is this all right?

13:14.790 --> 13:16.460
Leave that one alone!

13:16.460 --> 13:19.260
She won't ever know other people's pain!

13:22.760 --> 13:24.420
What?

13:26.400 --> 13:28.270
What are you doing?

13:28.270 --> 13:31.040
She knows the pain
of losing someone dear

13:31.040 --> 13:33.700
better than anyone else.

13:57.630 --> 14:00.900
Enemy approaching
the Nirvana's plotted course!

14:02.070 --> 14:03.870
H-H-Hey, what's with that speed?

14:03.870 --> 14:05.700
It's like we're surrounded!

14:15.820 --> 14:19.920
T-The enemy fleet
has gone into attack mode.

14:19.920 --> 14:22.410
So this is where the game of tag ends...

14:41.810 --> 14:44.380
Gasco, hurry!

14:44.380 --> 14:46.040
Wait, Big Sister!

14:47.950 --> 14:49.610
This way, hurry!

14:51.650 --> 14:54.720
All right? This is our secret!

14:54.720 --> 14:56.380
Yeah!

15:00.290 --> 15:01.900
It's done.

15:01.900 --> 15:03.560
Amazing!

15:10.340 --> 15:12.340
First Lieutenant Rheingau.

15:12.340 --> 15:15.180
All you've been giving me is excuses.

15:15.180 --> 15:18.810
Whimsical sympathy or poor
judgment due to anger

15:18.810 --> 15:21.380
puts lives in danger.

15:21.380 --> 15:23.620
Don't you understand that?

15:23.620 --> 15:26.190
But, Big Sister...

15:26.190 --> 15:27.960
Know your position, Lieutenant!

15:27.960 --> 15:29.220
On a mission...

15:29.220 --> 15:33.530
we have no relationship
other than officer and soldier.

15:33.530 --> 15:36.360
I apologize, Captain Rheingau.

15:37.870 --> 15:39.300
Don't disrupt the ranks!

15:39.300 --> 15:41.800
This unit will be
closed by the government.

15:41.800 --> 15:43.900
Everyone, please hurry aboard the ships!

15:43.900 --> 15:45.710
I'm not satisfied!

15:45.710 --> 15:48.080
This is our native land!

15:48.080 --> 15:50.380
This is an order, First Lieutenant.

15:50.380 --> 15:54.150
The sacrifices of the few
will save the many. It's logical.

15:54.150 --> 15:55.810
But...

15:58.020 --> 15:59.790
Part of the barrier appears

15:59.790 --> 16:03.290
to have been broken by those
against the forced evacuation!

16:03.290 --> 16:04.950
Captain!

16:17.240 --> 16:18.900
Captain!

16:27.150 --> 16:28.850
Captain! Captain!

16:28.850 --> 16:30.680
Stop it.

16:30.680 --> 16:32.620
But...

16:32.620 --> 16:33.950
It's

16:33.950 --> 16:35.820
already too late.

16:35.820 --> 16:36.990
Captain?

16:36.990 --> 16:39.290
I'll call for help right now so...

16:39.290 --> 16:40.950
Don't bother.

16:42.530 --> 16:43.530
That's right.

16:43.530 --> 16:46.200
This is our native land.

16:46.200 --> 16:49.970
That's why I wanted to
end it with my own hands.

16:52.670 --> 16:56.640
I'm sorry that I was so tough on you.

16:56.640 --> 16:59.180
I'll trust you with the rest.

16:59.180 --> 17:01.120
Gasco...

17:01.120 --> 17:02.550
Sister?

17:02.550 --> 17:04.240
Sister! Sister!

17:05.720 --> 17:09.590
Big Sister!

17:10.860 --> 17:14.500
It was just a couple dozen centimeters.

17:14.500 --> 17:19.270
Just one moment...
created an eternal farewell.

17:19.270 --> 17:21.740
If I had been calm...

17:21.740 --> 17:24.230
If I could've been logical...

17:25.770 --> 17:27.710
She...

17:27.710 --> 17:30.640
knows sorrow better than anyone else.

17:30.640 --> 17:33.380
How we're making a fuss now...

17:33.380 --> 17:38.010
For her, it's a path that
she's already taken before.

17:45.190 --> 17:47.130
Oh, all right.

17:47.130 --> 17:50.700
I guess I'll be honest and
apologize this one time...

17:50.700 --> 17:52.730
- This is Meia.
- We're surrounded.

17:52.730 --> 17:53.770
Nowhere to run.

17:53.770 --> 17:55.570
All the pilots are here right now.

17:55.570 --> 17:58.570
But attacking blindly
won't give us a victory.

17:58.570 --> 17:59.810
We need a plan...

17:59.810 --> 18:02.040
There is a plan!

18:02.040 --> 18:05.140
I thought of something,
hearing your story.

18:09.020 --> 18:11.090
Parfet, the Paksis again...

18:11.090 --> 18:12.390
Yeah.

18:12.390 --> 18:14.350
But something's clear now.

18:14.350 --> 18:15.820
What is it?

18:15.820 --> 18:18.260
The red color.

18:18.260 --> 18:20.890
There's another Paksis.

18:20.890 --> 18:23.500
And Earth is using it.

18:23.500 --> 18:27.700
Furthermore, this Paksis is
afraid of the red Paksis.

18:27.700 --> 18:29.270
Afraid?

18:29.270 --> 18:30.930
A machine?

18:32.540 --> 18:34.970
Here we go!

18:37.810 --> 18:39.450
Don't bother with the cubes.

18:39.450 --> 18:41.380
Our target is their mother ship!

18:50.620 --> 18:52.160
Someone staying inside...

18:52.160 --> 18:53.690
That gave me an idea!

18:53.690 --> 18:56.800
Getting inside its
belly and tearing it apart...

18:56.800 --> 18:58.270
That's the only plan left!

18:58.270 --> 19:00.300
Hibiki, that's too reckless.

19:00.300 --> 19:03.000
You never know unless you try!

19:03.000 --> 19:05.640
But that's what I like about you.

19:05.640 --> 19:08.230
You're ruining the mood...

19:09.780 --> 19:12.080
Here he comes, Mr. Alien!

19:12.080 --> 19:13.840
You come later!

19:19.820 --> 19:21.290
I understand your plan.

19:21.290 --> 19:23.860
But can our power penetrate the armor?

19:23.860 --> 19:25.330
We'll break through!

19:25.330 --> 19:27.420
If you're gonna worry, do it later!

19:36.140 --> 19:38.510
All ships, guard the entry squad!

19:38.510 --> 19:40.170
Roger!

19:43.740 --> 19:45.940
Go!

20:16.380 --> 20:18.210
What are you doing, Dita?

20:18.210 --> 20:20.580
You're going to be needed later!

20:20.580 --> 20:22.240
Sorry!

20:28.920 --> 20:30.120
Oh no!

20:30.120 --> 20:32.630
Barnette!

20:32.630 --> 20:34.860
Damn you!

20:39.470 --> 20:41.130
Damn!

20:52.050 --> 20:53.380
Sorry.

20:53.380 --> 20:56.210
Did I go too far for a stagehand?

21:05.490 --> 21:07.150
Ms. Gasco?

21:25.880 --> 21:27.510
Ms. Gasco...
